# Local DB dumps taken before destructive one-off scripts. Never committed.
.backups/

# Throwaway scripts somebody ran once against their own database - seeding a
# demo seller, linking offers, switching the active gateway. They import from
# `src/`, so they live here rather than in `scripts/`, and they are nobody
# else's business: one of them creates an ACTIVE account with a password
# written into the file, which is a backdoor the moment it meets the wrong
# DATABASE_URL.
#
# `eslint.config.js` ignores the same suffix, so a scratch script cannot fail
# `npm run verify` for a reason unrelated to the change being verified.
*.dev.ts
